<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan aluminium alloy output, shipments rise.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan aluminium alloy output, shipments rise.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's output and shipments of aluminium alloy rose in January from the same month a year ago, the Japan Aluminium Alloy Refiners' Association said.</p>
<p>The data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		   Jan 97	 yr/yr change</p>
<p> Output	  77,863	  +8.3 pct</p>
<p> Shipments     78,724	  +8.2 pct</p>
<p> Inventories   23,141	  -9.9 pct</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
